ady with error handling  \n✅ Multiple implementation options (Python/Bash)  \n✅ 48 KB comprehensive documentation  \n✅ 30+ practical code examples  \n✅ GitHub Actions automation template  \n✅ Cross-platform compatible (Linux/macOS/Windows)  \n✅ Read-only operations (no modifications)  \n\n### 📖 **Where to Start**\n1. Read `00_START_HERE.txt` (quick overview)\n2. Read `INDEX.md` (complete guide)\n3. Run `python3 collect_ml_health.py`\n4. Review data in `health-data/` directory\n5. See `USAGE_EXAMPLES.md` for custom analysis\n\n**All files are ready to use immediately!**\n","item_number":1}
